(text "05 4S input, one buck and independent rail isolation" (at 15 12 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2125337b-63e2-5e49-beca-f6c5c24f6cb8"))
(text "Shared J301/F301/D301 input barrier; converter/loadswitch NORMAL only. Protected4S:12.0-16.8V.\nFox-only retains input barrier/sense bypass, omits buck/loadswitch and watt-rail parts;2S powerscontroller+input sense.\nTPS22810 VIN must stay<=18V, including failed-buck transients;20V is absolute maximum.\n28V passive simulation is NOT a system rating. Input clamp/fault coordination remains OPEN." (at 15 23 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a81b19e8-bd29-5528-b057-593b40943452"))
